{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_34","type":"agent_message","text":"The direct three-weight GEMM is faster than concatenation across every workload, and a custom projection-weight GEMM also helps the smaller shapes. I found a further launch reduction: for small/medium cases, the norm-weight reduction can share the projection-weight GEMM launch because their work is independent. I’m implementing and validating that fused scheduling path now."}}
